# --- Obsidian -------------------------------------------------------------
# Per-user UI state: open tabs, pane layout, cursor positions. Changes on
# every click and conflicts on every pull between two people. Shared config
# (app.json, appearance.json, core-plugins.json, themes/) IS versioned, so
# both of you get the same plugins and theme.
**/.obsidian/workspace.json
**/.obsidian/workspace-mobile.json
**/.obsidian/cache
**/.obsidian/plugins/*/data.json

# --- OS cruft -------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# --- Editors --------------------------------------------------------------
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*~
